#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:5
#: 5b825692f7cb4f68bc52706cfbd518a5 6b615d27bdfb403695418209cb17b73b
#: 7b1ab33480b7449ea203f7bd0fe0b947 98d123a3db744270a362a1b006c950d6
#: 9de09b80e7474cf8a1d992c0426f2401 fd320db108bf40a89a6869db2421aaea
msgid "Connecting to FrSky Sport and FPort"
msgstr "连接 FrSky Sport 和 FPort"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:7
#: 0304d6f3d7b445f09ce5f6ea036217f0 21d8fd04308241f0be933421aabcdf5a
#: 506d0f6c8fcb4d2a81a93bc512533c7a 8c46ee3a49954a4982060b8f8923b294
#: a4b9a39612b24b53b1e4c6ebe86d45bf c0b6bd5c14454ba1996860d0187360ef
msgid ""
"Some FrSky receivers have the ability to relay telemetry data from the "
"vehicle to the transmitter."
msgstr "部分 FrSky 接收机具有将飞行器数传数据中继到发射机的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:9
#: 088bbe1897e649359472191cc7db5738 16ca0b4c40ae4772889e604e0efda466
#: 4b2f6c30b2604f02b30e23eaf87c4e9a bd564ed83a2d4a2587ace4436c6f78f6
#: eab1d983ff7e447b8e5da6aa1877056e f31140f63b394852b51cd4865750869d
msgid ""
"This was done initially via their SPort capability. And later, via an "
"additional new protocol called :ref:`FPort<common-Fport-receivers>` which "
"also includes the RC data to the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"最初通过其 SPort 功能实现。之后通过一个名为 :ref:`FPort<common-Fport-receivers>` "
"的新协议实现，该协议还包含发送给飞控的遥控数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:11
#: 14b148408ec74507a9d8ee76256eae99 417d3d1a021b4a278903c21f579d8c71
#: 4a8bebbd88b647a38fad1adc41a67daa 69a737208f6f4b29a83f7a6e3d4a367c
#: 89c7093f0aa0464b9b45ca75a618d306 ac6c57f5cc4c4063a7b7d0a07c710348
msgid ""
"In order to connect to these ports on the FrSky receiver, any UART on the "
"autopilot (normally a \"TELEM\" port) is used. However, both SPort and FPort"
" are bi-directional protocols and require signal inversion in both "
"directions in order to interface to the autopilot's UART."
msgstr ""
"为了连接到 FrSky 接收机上的这些端口，可以使用飞控上的任何 UART（通常是「TELEM」端口）。但是，SPort 和 FPort "
"都是双向协议，需要在两个方向上进行信号反转才能与飞控的 UART 对接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:13
#: 04f48fc1791143ae8148cc16622c85e3 1cfa24257c7044beb6c634bcd13eb05e
#: 1e16eb4905a34593b162bc458dd4c1b9 45aea4a214f94a728399cec00b6adfa7
#: a19210a8c9614b1fb7d12be877a75c1f ebe28bcf97d74b2f857a8167fc89779e
msgid ""
"if Sport is being used to send telemetry, then RC data must still be sent to"
" the autopilot via its RCin pin as PPM or SBus from the FrSky receiver. See "
":ref:`common-flight-controller-wiring`."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Sport 发送数传，则 RC 数据仍必须通过其 RCin 引脚以 PPM 或 SBus 方式从 FrSky 接收机发送到飞控。请参阅 "
":ref:`common-flight-controller-wiring`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:15
#: 061cdaf8086640f19aa3db67a9816e6e 0dadfdf87abb428cab1dfce4fad12add
#: 2df1f3d397954ce78e294261c80d18f8 598200f4ebae4540bc2d9d20827c8af4
#: 82befe75289044e2b7ee1c0640bc6134 913d6124ae1742bdad89077767d2028c
msgid ""
"If the autopilot uses an F7 or H7 processor, then this can be done by "
"appropriately configuring the UART port on the autopilot. However, most F4 "
"based autopilots do not have this capability and required inverters "
"externally. A few F4 autopilots have these on the boards themselves and "
"label the port \"FrSky Telem\", but most do not. Those require an added "
":ref:`bi-directional inverter <frsky_cables>` connected between the "
"autopilot and the receiver's SPort or FPort."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控使用 F7 或 H7 处理器，则可以通过适当配置飞控上的 UART 端口来实现。但是，大多数基于 F4 的飞控不具备此功能，需要外部反相器。少数"
" F4 飞控板上集成了这些功能，并将端口标记为「FrSky Telem」，但大多数没有。这些需要在飞控和接收机的 SPort 或 FPort 之间添加 "
":ref:`双向反相器 <frsky_cables>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:17
#: 17ce144a21a94f57aa507c6acd4aab4a 27471e7db0344c979dcd93ce138971e5
#: 48348fdec79a40bebf146a169c1be687 5186d7ecbce44208be149f45beef815d
#: 7811ebb9cc684857bf429eb3ab674435 7be791d8056f408dac95059787a76a17
msgid ""
"F4 autopilots with on-board inversion (Pixracer,MindPX V2) default to having"
" the inversion on their ports designated for FRsky telem, only requiring "
"that the TX and RX pins be tied together and connected to the Sport/Fport on"
" the receiver and the appropriate ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` be set for that port."
msgstr ""
"具有板载反相（Pixracer、MindPX V2）的 F4 飞控默认在专用于 FRsky 数传的端口上启用反相，只需将 TX 和 RX "
"引脚连接在一起并连接到接收机上的 Sport/Fport，并为该端口设置适当的 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:19
#: 34b01704de904aa685998c8501067bb8 6633f353f17c44c3935f922472bd6bb5
#: 732badc9d20749cc842833c6d7ad924b afe736b4c0254efd9d3ba4edd0cef929
#: de419b3ec1ae404d9943b856aaebacc7 e4eb29d66b3741b08afec90acb6b11e7
msgid ""
"In addition, some FrSky receivers provide an optional pad with the SPort or "
"FPort already \"inverted\", so no external inversion is required if that is "
"used."
msgstr "此外，一些 FrSky 接收机提供了已经「反相」的 SPort 或 FPort 可选焊盘，如果使用该焊盘，则不需要外部反相。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-sport-fport.rst:21
#: 3007ba9a3aab4eaeb1c7de1ec4472521 469f8f2362174e7f9a19bee7d4206965
#: 5c53aa40168f4f6db0cab8c269b349fb 8e2b0d2da9e44a2c8c69f9c8a788afc5
